{
  "id": "i02-l02",
  "unit": "i02-and-then",
  "title": "On foot, by rickshaw",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "The participle also says **how** you do something:\n\n- **হেঁটে** 'on foot' (lit. having walked), **দৌড়ে** 'running'\n- **রিকশা করে** 'by rickshaw', **মন দিয়ে** 'attentively', **চুপ করে** 'quietly'\n\n**আমি হেঁটে অফিসে যাই** 'I walk to the office.'\n\nFor transport, **রিকশা করে** and **রিকশায়** (Unit 7) both work.\n\n**ধীরে ধীরে** is 'slowly, gradually'; everyday **আস্তে** is 'slowly, gently'.\n\n**ভিজে গেলাম** 'I got soaked': participle + **গেলাম** for something that happened to you.",
  "vocab": [
